Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Overlaps and nonlocal projections are exact sums over local G.
A DGEMM whose K dimension is the local G count, followed by MPI_SUM
of the rounded block, changes with the rank split.
exact_ovlap_fill and exact_pairsum add each G term, allreduce the
digits, and round once. The gamma rgs triangular multiply is the same
explicit sum, so it does not use DTRMM.

